<h1>Asserted environment</h1>

<%= render partial: 'attributes' %>

<em class="notice">
  Asserted environments can not be edited here - their ENVO term must come
  from an autoselect/autocomplete, and their object can not be changed. Use
  the radial menu on the object below (its "Asserted environments" panel) to
  add, edit, reorder, or remove its environment assertions.
</em>

<p>
  <strong>Object:</strong>
  <%= object_link(@asserted_environment.asserted_environment_object) %>
  <%= otus_radial(@asserted_environment.asserted_environment_object) %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to 'Back', @asserted_environment %>
</p>
